Task:
Traces:
AI-Role:
AI-Verdict:
AI-Note:
#
# Task:        plan task id, e.g. D8-3
# Traces:      requirement/story ids, e.g. REQ-LIVE-007, US-041
# AI-Role:     requirements-analyst | architect | domain-modeller | ux-designer
#              | implementer | reviewer | test-engineer | technical-writer | none
# AI-Verdict:  accepted | accepted-with-edits | rejected | not-used
# AI-Note:     one line — what you changed or why you rejected it.
#              This is the line that becomes assessment evidence. Be specific:
#              "rejected its EF Include chain, produced an N+1 across JourneyStop"
#              beats "fixed AI code".
#
# Enable once:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
